{"material_id": "ntce.youer.zonghe.2013a.q29.material.recovered", "text": "材料一：今天的午点是香蕉，拿到香蕉后，王浩马上双手握住香蕉，眯着眼睛，“叭”的向吴老师开了一“枪”，小朋友们都笑了起来，吴老师没有生气，而是问小朋友们：“王浩觉得香蕉像一把枪，你们觉得像什么？小朋友们看着手里的香蕉，纷纷说：像小船，像月亮，像香肠……” 材料二：吃香蕉的时候，吴老师问：“香蕉吃到嘴里是什么感觉？”小朋友们纷纷回答：“很甜”、“很软”、“粘牙”、“和橙子不一样，它没核”…… 材料三：吃完香蕉，吴老师问：“香蕉皮像什么？…‘降落伞”、“一朵花”、“一只大章鱼”…… 材料四：以往，老师会要求小朋友们把香蕉皮丢进垃圾筒里。可今天，吴老师要求小朋友们把香蕉皮留在桌面上，并给小朋友们提供了绳子、透明胶、剪刀等工具，兴趣盎然地带领大家玩起香蕉皮来。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2194, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2523, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2013a.q29"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.m1.k1", "ntce.youer.zonghe.m1.k2", "ntce.youer.zonghe.m1.k3"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.ethics"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.101.r001", "ntce.outline.101.r002", "ntce.outline.101.r004", "ntce.outline.101.r005", "ntce.outline.101.r008", "ntce.outline.101.r010", "ntce.outline.101.r013"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2013a.q29"], "word_count": 329, "level": "youer", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2194, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2523, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "expires_at": null, "source_nature": "official_exam", "nature_note": "教育主管部门公开发布的考试试题", "nature_evidence": "filename_pattern:官方真题命名", "attribution_required": false}}}
{"material_id": "ntce.youer.zonghe.2013a.q31.material.recovered", "text": "有人说，沉默是金，因为祸从口出，许多麻烦往往因为自己的多嘴，而且沉默还可以表示深沉，表示有城府；有人说。慷慨是金，因为在当今社会里，只要你能大方地给，必定能得到丰厚的回报；有人说智慈是金……也许都不错．但我认为，热情、主动才是真正的金，才是自己拥有的金，才是别人无法抢夺的金。主动，就是从时间上超前一步，是九点钟要赶到的，你不妨八点五十分赶到，这样你就不用担心搭不上急驶而来的时代列车。主动，就是从范围上扩大一些，要你了解衬衫，你不妨顺便了解一下西装、领带以及鞋子和帽子，这样你的视野就会更加开阔。主动，就是从程度上加深一层，为什么在键盘上这么简单地敲击几下，文字就输入了？别的输入方法是不是会更简单？主动．就是从动作和态度上力求积极一点儿、敏锐一点儿，当别人尚未意识到时，你已经强烈地意识到了：当别人刚刚起步时，你已经走在途中了；当别人正想找你时，你已经敲门进去了……人生不能被动．生活需要主动。只有主动，才能不断地获得上进的机遇；只有主动，才能超越别人；只有主动，才能牢牢地把握胜券。（《主动是金》朱华贤《中国校外教育（优等生）》2008年第5期）", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2609, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3085, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2013a.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.m5.k1", "ntce.youer.zonghe.m5.k2", "ntce.youer.zonghe.m5.k4"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.literacy"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2013a.q31"], "word_count": 476, "level": "youer", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2609, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3085, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "expires_at": null, "source_nature": "official_exam", "nature_note": "教育主管部门公开发布的考试试题", "nature_evidence": "filename_pattern:官方真题命名", "attribution_required": false}}}
{"material_id": "ntce.youer.zonghe.2013a.q32.material.recovered", "text": "成长是美丽的，它一路走着，一路扫撒着缤纷的花朵；成长是神奇的，它引领着我们去创造一个又一个生命的奇迹；成长是忧郁的，它意味着一次次告别的仪式，和亲人，和自己……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3159, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3239, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2013a.q32"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.m5.k1", "ntce.youer.zonghe.m5.k4"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.literacy"], "exam_requirement_ids": [], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2013a.q32"], "word_count": 80, "level": "youer", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3159, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3239, "next_source_question_number": 33, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2013年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 32, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "2464b947be0719b65050e06aac7456841bed229fabcb3b8c9736e7bd9b21d1b5"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "expires_at": 